          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Samweli shiyatsia okhumukoonyakhwo Saulo khandi tawe, okhuula khunyanga yokhufwakhwe; habula Samweli yamwikhuula Saulo; naye OMWAMI yatsuunwa omwoyo khulwa okhumukhola Saulo omuruchi waIsiraeli.",
          "type": "text",
